# Production: files.multimc.org, defaults.env as it is but for what Laminar runs instead of
# hopper. Exists so every setup is named by a settings file (hopper@production runs
# daemon/hopper.py --config config/production.env).
# The translations, the website and the Patreon credits are Laminar's jobs
# translations-production, website-production, patrons-production (laminar/cfg/jobs)
HOPPER_HANDED_OFF=translations website patrons
